<title>FINLAND: Finnish raw wood prices mixed in Jan - METLA.</title>
<headline>Finnish raw wood prices mixed in Jan - METLA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish raw wood stumpage prices were mixed in January (weeks 2-5), the Finnish Forest Research Institute METLA said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Pine pulpwood stumpage prices and birch logwood prices fell in January, it said.</p>
<p>Pulpwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>	     Jan '97    Dec '96     1995	H2 '95	H1 '95</p>
<p> Pine	  97.00	98.10    93.00	 93.20	 92.90</p>
<p> Spruce     126.20     123.40   109.70	109.00	110.20</p>
<p> Birch	 94.50	94.30    98.20	 98.00	 98.40</p>
<p>Logwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>	     Jan '97    Dec '96     1995	 H2 '95     H1 '95</p>
<p> Pine	 251.40     248.00   247.10	 244.60     249.30</p>
<p> Spruce     207.30     205.60   197.60	 192.40     201.00</p>
<p> Birch	246.60     247.20   244.10	 240.70     246.70</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
